# PROPOSED CODEOWNERS — authority overlay (DRAFT)
# Rename to `CODEOWNERS` (or `.github/CODEOWNERS`) to activate, AFTER:
#   1) the zone restructure is executed, and 2) real GitHub handles/teams replace the placeholders below.
# Replace: @owner = the repository owner (e.g. @idris-manley); @eng-lead = engineering lead's handle.
#
# Semantics: the listed owners are REQUIRED reviewers for changes under that path.
# - 00_owner: owner only (governs all zones; canonical changes route through Framework 001).
# - 10_product: product-authoritative (owner acts as PM today).
# - 20_handoff: CO-GOVERNED SEAM — BOTH owner and engineering required on every change.
# - 30_engineering: engineering-authoritative (default author = eng); owner still ratifies CANON changes.
# - 90_research: non-canonical; no required owner.

# --- Default: owner sees everything not otherwise matched ---
*                       @owner

# --- 00_owner — owner only (doctrine, constitution, frameworks, decisions, glossary, TBD/queue) ---
/00_owner/              @owner
# Build-governance is owner-ratified policy that binds engineering (deployment/QA/observability
# governance, Anti-Assumption Protocol, implementation constraints, AI-First delivery rules).
# Engineering may PROPOSE edits; the owner RATIFIES. Owner-required even though eng is a co-reviewer:
/00_owner/build_governance/   @owner @eng-lead

# --- 10_product — product-authoritative (engineering reads) ---
/10_product/            @owner

# --- 20_handoff — THE SEAM — both signatures required ---
/20_handoff/            @owner @eng-lead

# --- 30_engineering — engineering-authoritative (product reads) ---
/30_engineering/        @eng-lead
# (Reminder: changes to ratified architecture CANON still require owner ratification via Framework 001,
#  even though engineering is the default author here. CODEOWNERS enforces review, not ratification.)

# --- 90_research — non-canonical ---
/90_research/           @owner @eng-lead

# --- Cross-zone meta / infra (owner-controlled; agents read these) ---
/CLAUDE.md              @owner
/AGENTS.md              @owner
/README.md              @owner
/START_HERE.md          @owner
/REPOSITORY_ARCHITECTURE.md   @owner
/REPOSITORY_INDEX.md    @owner
/CODEOWNERS             @owner
/tools/                 @owner @eng-lead
/.github/               @owner @eng-lead
